# Copyable tables

Never use GitHub-flavored markdown tables in chat replies. They do not copy cleanly.

Put every table inside a fenced code block so the user can copy it in one click. Prefer a markdown table inside the fence, or an aligned text table. Keep a blank line before and after the fence.

```
| Kind | Example | Status |
|---|---|---|
| Bad input | invalid email | 400 |
```
